# Versification "BSB"
# Written for Epigrapho. The Berean Standard Bible numbers verses like the KJV
# tradition — fourteen verses in 3 John, seventeen in Revelation 12 — but it
# differs in where the seventeenth ends: measured, BSB closes 12:17 with "And
# the dragon stood on the shore of the sea", the sentence English numbers
# 12:18, while VBL and KJV open chapter 13 with it. So there is no mapping
# line here: the canonical 12:18 simply lands on this chapter's last verse.
#! base = eng

3JN 1:14
REV 12:17
